# ============================================================================
# STARADIO EBIKE — public marketing repo
#
# ⛔ THIS REPO IS A SHOP WINDOW. It is published on GitHub.
#    Supplier quotations, BOM files and supplier contact details must NEVER
#    be committed here. The authoritative rules are in README.md
#    ("Publishing Rules").
#
# ⚠️ A filename filter is only a speed bump, not a security control — anyone
#    can rename a file to get past it. The real rule is: if in doubt, it does
#    not go in.
# ============================================================================

